<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter has stake in US auto supply company.</title>
<headline>Rieter has stake in US auto supply company.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textile machinery and auto parts maker Rieter Holding AG said it acquired a 50 percent stake in the privately-owned U.S. automotive carpet maker Magee.</p>
<p>Terms of the arrangement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Magee, based in Bloomsbury, Pennsylvania, employs some 670 people and is expected to generate sales of nearly $100 million this year.</p>
<p>It holds a market share in North America of some 10 percent, Rieter also said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
